  "ContentHtml": "<p>For two strings <code>s</code> and <code>t</code>, we say &quot;<code>t</code> divides <code>s</code>&quot; if and only if <code>s = t + t + t + ... + t + t</code> (i.e., <code>t</code> is concatenated with itself one or more times).</p>\n\n<p>Given two strings <code>str1</code> and <code>str2</code>, return <em>the largest string </em><code>x</code><em> such that </em><code>x</code><em> divides both </em><code>str1</code><em> and </em><code>str2</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">str1 = &quot;ABCABC&quot;, str2 = &quot;ABC&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;ABC&quot;</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">str1 = &quot;ABABAB&quot;, str2 = &quot;ABAB&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;AB&quot;</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">str1 = &quot;LEET&quot;, str2 = &quot;CODE&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;&quot;</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 4:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">str1 = &quot;AAAAAB&quot;, str2 = &quot;AAA&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;&quot;</span>​​​​​​​</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= str1.length, str2.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n\t<li><code>str1</code> and <code>str2</code> consist of English uppercase letters.</li>\n</ul>\n"
